CurrentAmount [SimTalk] - Tank
Returns the Current Amount of the material in the Tank designated by <Path>.
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>.CurrentAmount → real
Return Value
The return value has the data type real.
The current amount is measured in liters.
Example
print MyTank.CurrentAmount
